'''Hangers''' are dead Shopkeepers that are hostile. They can shoot 3 projectiles at the player that will steal coins on hit (similar to {{E|Greed}} and {{E|Keeper}}s). The Hanger is very slow and can float over obstacles. The best strategy is to be constantly moving. They always have an {{E|Eternal Fly}} circling them, which will become an {{E|Attack Fly}} once the Hanger is dead.

